WEBVTT

00:13:58.458 --> 00:14:01.003
would be available not just
at Planned Parenthoods

00:14:01.044 --> 00:14:04.089
and the dwindling number
of abortion clinics in this country,

00:14:04.089 --> 00:14:06.717
but at pharmacies without a prescription,

00:14:06.717 --> 00:14:08.552
at walk-in health centers

00:14:08.552 --> 00:14:12.431
and on every college campus
in the United States.

00:14:12.431 --> 00:14:17.936
(Applause)

00:14:17.936 --> 00:14:19.855
And if you had any doubt

00:14:19.897 --> 00:14:24.192
about the importance
of getting politically active,

00:14:24.192 --> 00:14:27.446
we could also pass

00:14:27.446 --> 00:14:30.240
a constitutional amendment,